      "content": "If you are feeling like you want to end your life, please know that there are people who want to support you through this darkness right now. You can connect with compassionate and trained individuals by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, or by calling 111 in the UK. These services are free, confidential, and available 24/7. Please reach out to them immediately.",
      "source": "target",
